{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o141a","title":"陆逊为丞相","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o141a-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"陆逊为丞相","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o141a-q"]},{"id":"luxun-e-o051a-account","label":"《陆逊传第十三》正文","text":"孙权使傅常授陆议丞相印绶原官如故","evidence":["luxun-e-o051a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xianzhu-p0115","role":"任丞相","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o141a-q"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"任用","evidence":["luxun-e-o051a-q"]},{"person":"luxun-p0042","role":"授印","evidence":["luxun-e-o051a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":244,"label":"赤乌七年春正月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y244","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o141","basis":"赤乌七年春正月"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o141a-q","wuzhu-q-o141","shaodi-q-o022","shaodi-q-b-7eb87839c414a706f2aa"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o141a-q","source_order":[47,711,"O141a"],"order":8369}],"persons":[{"id":"luxun-p0042","name":"傅常","evidence":["luxun-q-o051"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"luxun-m-o051-luxun-p0042","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["luxun-q-o051"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"luxun-e-o051a-q","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-fd5a16fa8f9b93ba1c27","layer":"original","quote":"赤乌七年，代顾雍为丞相。诏曰：“朕以不德，应期践运；王途未一，奸宄充路〖1〗；夙夜战惧，不遑鉴寐〖2〗。惟君天资聪睿，明德显融〖3〗；统任上将，匡国弭难〖4〗。夫有超世之功者，必应光大之宠；怀文武之才者，必荷社稷之重〖5〗。昔伊尹隆汤〖6〗，吕尚翼周〖7〗；内外之任〖8〗，君实兼之。今以君为丞相，使使持节、守太常傅常〖9〗，授印绶。君其茂昭明德，修乃懿绩〖10〗；敬服王命，绥靖四方。於乎〖11〗！总司三事〖12〗，以训群僚，可不敬与〖13〗？君其勖之〖14〗！其州牧、都护、领武昌事，如故。”","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":245,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":248},{"id":"luxun-q-o051","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-fd5a16fa8f9b93ba1c27","layer":"original","quote":"赤乌七年，代顾雍为丞相。诏曰：“朕以不德，应期践运；王途未一，奸宄充路〖1〗；夙夜战惧，不遑鉴寐〖2〗。惟君天资聪睿，明德显融〖3〗；统任上将，匡国弭难〖4〗。夫有超世之功者，必应光大之宠；怀文武之才者，必荷社稷之重〖5〗。昔伊尹隆汤〖6〗，吕尚翼周〖7〗；内外之任〖8〗，君实兼之。今以君为丞相，使使持节、守太常傅常〖9〗，授印绶。君其茂昭明德，修乃懿绩〖10〗；敬服王命，绥靖四方。於乎〖11〗！总司三事〖12〗，以训群僚，可不敬与〖13〗？君其勖之〖14〗！其州牧、都护、领武昌事，如故。”","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":245,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":248},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-7eb87839c414a706f2aa","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-7eb87839c414a706f2aa","layer":"modern","quote":"〖13〗五年：正始五年（公元 244）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":96,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-f0539e2dfb395a33b142","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"shaodi-q-o022","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-93d5da2e078d5ca12eb0","layer":"original","quote":"五年春二月〖13〗，诏大将军曹爽率众征蜀。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o141a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-acf1716946dfe5894375","layer":"original","quote":"七年春正月〖13〗，以上大将军陆逊为丞相。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":199,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o141","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-acf1716946dfe5894375","layer":"original","quote":"七年春正月〖13〗，以上大将军陆逊为丞相。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":199,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
